    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;It's Ironic how much you hate robots considering you're at least 70% necrobots by now. Every time one of us brings you back you get a little less human.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as X a mercenary whose job is being replaced by robots and is reskilling into necromancy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X has watched the job postings dwindle as mercenary's are replaced by androids. After death number 74 while working as a bodyguard for a necromancer (one of the few people left to hire human bodyguards) X decided to start learning a new career.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NecroMerc is a twist on the classic FPS genre with RPG necromancy mechanics. You might be shooting enemies while also summoning skeletons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's set in a futuristic setting where you play on different planets as well as on space stations. The environments are a mix of sci-fi, cyberpunk, and horror. You get to choose missions and travel to different worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skill tree lets you choose between improving your shooting and several different branches of necromancy.\u00a0 You could specialize in summoning, poisons, or necrohacking.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;It's Ironic how much you hate robots considering you're at least 70% necrobots by now. Every time one of us brings you back you get a little less human.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as X a mercenary whose job is being replaced by robots and is reskilling into necromancy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X has watched the job postings dwindle as mercenary's are replaced by androids. After death number 74 while working as a bodyguard for a necromancer (one of the few people left to hire human bodyguards) X decided to start learning a new career.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NecroMerc is a twist on the classic FPS genre with RPG necromancy mechanics. You might be shooting enemies while also summoning skeletons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's set in a futuristic setting where you play on different planets as well as on space stations. The environments are a mix of sci-fi, cyberpunk, and horror. You get to choose missions and travel to different worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skill tree lets you choose between improving your shooting and several different branches of necromancy.\u00a0 You could specialize in summoning, poisons, or necrohacking.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
